        </p>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/sms/dashboard">Dashboard</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    High-level executive monitoring of enrollment trends, fee collection status, 
                    academic performance distribution, and daily attendance metrics.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/sms/admissions">Admissions & Enrollment</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Digital intake management including online application forms, document staging, 
                    waiting lists, and automated student ID generation.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/sms/attendance">Attendance Tracking</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Digital registers for daily and period-by-period roll-call. Automated 
                    WhatsApp/SMS alerts for absent students sent directly to parents.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/sms/academics">Grades & Assessments</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Continuous Assessment (CA) tracking, ZIMSEC-aligned grading scales, class ranking, 
                    and branded PDF report card generation.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/sms/fees">Fee Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Multi-currency billing (USD/ZiG), sibling discount management, EcoCash 
                    reconciliation, and automated arrears notification engine.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/sms/examinations">Examinations</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Internal exam scheduling, invigilator workload balancing, seating plan 
                    generation, and result upload workflows.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/sms/portals">Parent & Student Portals</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Secure self-service access to results, fee balances, school announcements, 
                    and WhatsApp chatbot for instant record lookup.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/sms/staff">Staff & Payroll</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Academic staff records, qualifications archival, leave tracking, and ZIMRA-compliant 
                    payroll for education professionals.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/sms/library">Library (PindahLibra)</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Dewey Decimal cataloging, barcode-based borrowing, overdue fine calculation, 
                    and digital resource repository.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/sms/boarding">Hostel & Boarding</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Room and bed allocation, boarding fee schedules, exeat application workflows, 
                    and nightly roll-call logs.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">The Digital Campus Experience</h2>
        <p>
            Transform your school into a digitally connected campus. Frame eliminates the 
            bottlenecks of paper-based administration by providing a single, authoritative 
            source of truth for student records, academic results, and financial data. 
            Teachers manage their mark-books and attendance registers digitally, while 
            administrative staff handle complex fee billing and admissions through a 
            unified interface, ensuring that the school's structural integrity 
            remains resilient even at high enrollment volumes.
        </p>
        <p>
            Native integration with the Pindah notification engine ensures that parents are 
            always informed. Whether it's a routine school circular, an emergency 
            closure notice, or an automated alert for an absent student, Frame 
            bridges the communication gap between the school and home through 
            the channels parents use most: WhatsApp and SMS.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Academic Excellence & Result Integrity</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain the highest standards of academic reporting with our ZIMSEC-aligned results 
            engine. Frame supports the creation of complex Continuous Assessment (CA) 
            structures, allowing teachers to weight tests, projects, and final exams 
            according to departmental requirements. The system automatically computes 
            grades, class rankings, and subject distribution analytics, providing 
            academic leadership with the data needed to identify performance trends 
            and target interventions where they are most needed.
        </p>
        <p>
            Professional, branded PDF report cards are generated with a single click, 
            complete with historical graphs of student progress, allowing for a 
            modern and prestigious presentation of the school's academic results.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Sophisticated Fee & Financial Stewardship</h2>
        <p>
            Drive financial sustainability with a fee management engine built for the Zimbabwean 
            multi-currency economy. Frame handles the simultaneous billing and receipting 
            of fees in USD and ZiG, with support for complex sibling discounts, 
            scholarships, and boarding-specific schedules. Automated reconciliation 
            with EcoCash and bank platforms ensures that the finance office has 
            real-time visibility of the school's cash position.
        </p>
        <p>
            Fee clearance checks are integrated directly into the academic and portal workflows, 
            ensuring that report cards and other premium school services are only 
            accessible to students with settled accounts, protecting the school's 
            revenue without administrative friction.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

